WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.496 --> 00:00:08.416
was Christmas Eve.

2
00:00:09.537 --> 00:00:12.739
Billy and his sister, Lindsey, were playing hide and seek.

3
00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:15.740
Billy was looking for a place to hide.

4
00:00:16.921 --> 00:00:23.165
53, 54, 55, 56 "Oh, no!

5
00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:25.066
I can't go in there.

6
00:00:25.506 --> 00:00:28.928
Mom is busy making pies," said Billy.

7
00:00:30.084 --> 00:00:36.267
60, 61, 62, 63 "Oh, no!

8
00:00:36.807 --> 00:00:38.788
I can't go in there either!"

9
00:00:39.768 --> 00:00:40.988
he said in a whisper.

10
00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:47.171
Billy's father was Doctor Vinton, a famous animal doctor.

11
00:00:48.611 --> 00:00:49.952
He was talking on the phone.

12
00:00:50.852 --> 00:00:52.153
He looked very worried.

13
00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.274
Billy knew he shouldn't bother his father.

14
00:00:57.355 --> 00:00:58.655
"You say they're sick?

15
00:00:59.096 --> 00:00:59.636
All of them?

16
00:01:00.252 --> 00:01:01.373
What's wrong with them?"

17
00:01:02.134 --> 00:01:03.214
asked Billy's father.

18
00:01:06.477 --> 00:01:12.882
67, 68, 69, 70 Billy ran upstairs.

19
00:01:13.682 --> 00:01:15.463
He ran into his parents' bedroom.

20
00:01:15.483 --> 00:01:21.528
"She always checks under the bed," Billy said to himself.

21
00:01:22.569 --> 00:01:26.772
"She always checks in the closets too," he whispered.

22
00:01:28.864 --> 00:01:31.866
"But she never looks in my father's luggage.

23
00:01:32.486 --> 00:01:35.408
I'll hide in there," said Billy happily.

24
00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:40.190
98, 99, 100.

25
00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:43.452
Ready or not, here I come!"

26
00:01:44.132 --> 00:01:45.073
shouted Lindsey.

27
00:01:45.633 --> 00:01:48.175
It was dark and warm in his father's luggage.

28
00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:50.236
Billy soon fell asleep.

29
00:01:52.897 --> 00:01:57.760
Downstairs, Billy's father had just finished his telephone call with Santa Claus.

30
00:02:00.256 --> 00:02:06.841
Santa Claus had called to tell him that his reindeer were very sick—so sick that they couldn't fly.

31
00:02:06.861 --> 00:02:12.285
"They're sending a car to take me to the airport.

32
00:02:12.705 --> 00:02:16.608
It should be here in a few minutes," said Doctor Vinton to his wife.

33
00:02:16.628 --> 00:02:19.410
"What should I tell the kids?"

34
00:02:20.231 --> 00:02:20.951
asked his wife.

35
00:02:20.971 --> 00:02:27.176
"Tell them that some animals are very sick, and I need to help them," he said.

36
00:02:28.904 --> 00:02:30.666
There was a loud knock on the door.

37
00:02:31.646 --> 00:02:34.669
A man in a dark suit and dark glasses walked in.

38
00:02:34.689 --> 00:02:40.274
"Doctor Vinton, I've been sent by the president," said the gentleman.

39
00:02:40.294 --> 00:02:41.495
"Are you ready?"

40
00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:42.776
he asked.

41
00:02:45.778 --> 00:02:47.800
"Yes," said Billy's father.

42
00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.582
"I have a bag packed.

43
00:02:50.002 --> 00:02:51.463
It's upstairs in the closet.

44
00:02:52.144 --> 00:02:53.265
Can you get it for me?

45
00:02:53.765 --> 00:02:56.948
I will get my instruments and some medicine from my office."

46
00:02:58.376 --> 00:03:00.218
The man nodded and went upstairs.

47
00:03:00.978 --> 00:03:02.540
He found the bag in the closet.

48
00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:06.543
"Wow! This bag is heavy," said the man.

49
00:03:08.845 --> 00:03:11.307
The man took the suitcase and put it in the car.

50
00:03:12.227 --> 00:03:15.990
Billy's father joined the man in the car, and they drove to the airport.

51
00:03:17.271 --> 00:03:22.535
At the airport, the president's plane was waiting to take Doctor Vinton to the North Pole.

52
00:03:26.899 --> 00:03:29.997
When Billy woke up, he wasn't sure where he was.

53
00:03:30.657 --> 00:03:32.038
He was very surprised.

54
00:03:32.959 --> 00:03:35.280
He saw his father speaking with Santa Claus.

55
00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:38.302
"Daddy! Daddy!"

56
00:03:39.002 --> 00:03:39.683
called Billy.

57
00:03:39.703 --> 00:03:41.664
"Where are we?

58
00:03:42.264 --> 00:03:45.206
And why are you talking to Santa Claus?"

59
00:03:49.108 --> 00:03:51.770
Billy's father was even more surprised than Billy.

60
00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:55.612
"What? How how did you get here?"

61
00:03:56.568 --> 00:03:58.330
asked Billy's father in amazement.

62
00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:02.013
"I was playing hide-and-seek with Lindsey.

63
00:04:02.554 --> 00:04:04.015
I hid in your suitcase.

64
00:04:04.595 --> 00:04:07.478
She didn't find me so I guess I won!"

65
00:04:08.079 --> 00:04:09.500
shouted Billy excitedly.

66
00:04:11.382 --> 00:04:20.310
Santa Claus smiled and said, "Yes, Billy, you won, but your father and I are very busy.

67
00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:27.071
My reindeer are sick, and he needs to find out how to make them better.

68
00:04:27.773 --> 00:04:31.243
Will you be a good boy and help my elves?"
